vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hendrikmuhs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"MEMBER","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"Transforms should allow a destination index that refers to an alias as long as that alias as a single writing writing index specified. \r\n\r\n```\r\nDELETE idx*\r\n\r\nPUT idx_1\r\nPUT idx_2\r\n\r\nPOST _aliases\r\n{\r\n  \"actions\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"add\": {\r\n        \"index\": \"idx_1\",\r\n        \"alias\": \"idx\"\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"add\": {\r\n        \"index\": \"idx_2\",\r\n        \"alias\": \"idx\",\r\n        \"is_write_index\": true\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  ]\r\n}\r\n\r\n# below works\r\nPUT idx/_doc/to_alias\r\n{\r\n  \"a\": \"a\"\r\n}\r\n\r\nGET idx/_search\r\n```\r\nTransform creation currently fails:\r\n```\r\nPUT _transform/trans_idx\r\n{\r\n  \"source\": {\r\n    \"index\": [\r\n      \"source-*\"\r\n    ]\r\n  },\r\n  \"pivot\": {\r\n    \"group_by\": {\r\n      \"field\": {\r\n        \"terms\": {\r\n          \"field\": \"my_field\"\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    },\r\n    \"aggregations\": {\r\n      \"@timestamp.max\": {\r\n        \"max\": {\r\n          \"field\": \"@timestamp\"\r\n        }\r\n      }\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  \"dest\": {\r\n    \"index\": \"idx\"\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nFailure:\r\n```\r\n{\r\n  \"error\": {\r\n    \"root_cause\": [\r\n      {\r\n        \"type\": \"status_exception\",\r\n        \"reason\": \"Destination index [idx] should refer to a single index\"\r\n      }\r\n    ],\r\n    \"type\": \"status_exception\",\r\n    \"reason\": \"Destination index [idx] should refer to a single index\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"status\": 400\r\n}\r\n```","closed_by":{"login":"hendrikmuhs","id":7126422,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMjY0MjI=","avat